        "Title": "Double Trouble in Sapienza",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COASTALTOWN",
        "PublicId": "103777959880",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 818edace-fefe-410c-b5f7-747a677c618d).Image",
        "Description": "Your targets are two accomplices in the murder of a wealthy man from Sapienza. Both were his lovers, and after learning of each other&apos;s identities, they planned and executed his swift death, followed by the theft of his property. Paola Mafucci plans to visit the murdered&apos;s grave, apparently out of guilt. Berto Lo Cascio, the mastermind behind the plot, has been spotted strolling through the city, but you&apos;ll have to find her exact location yourself.\rI&apos;ll leave you to prepare.",
